\section{Empirical Evaluation and Results}

\subsection{Questionnaire Benchmark Audit & Tautology Sweep}
Table~\ref{tab:threshold_sweep} reports the threshold sweep concordance audit across all four cohorts. For Adult, Adolescent, and Child benchmarks, setting threshold $\tau = 7$ yields exactly 100.0\,\% concordance with the dataset target column across every single instance ($0$ discordant cases). For the Toddler Q-CHAT-10 dataset, setting $\tau = 4$ yields 100.0\,\% concordance ($0$ discordant cases).

