& Logistic Regression (Var A) & 0.9943 $\pm$ 0.0122 & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 0.9895 $\pm$ 0.0226 & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 0.0296 & 0.1111 \\
& Stacking Ensemble (Var A) & 0.9771 $\pm$ 0.0167 & 0.9792 $\pm$ 0.0280 & 0.9755 $\pm$ 0.0226 & 0.9976 $\pm$ 0.0033 & 0.0269 & 0.0874 \\
\midrule
