& Logistic Regression (Var A) & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 1.0000 $\pm$ 0.0000 & 0.0132 & 0.0589 \\
